  "program": {
    "module": {
      "summary": "SPIKE A (TECHNICAL DISCOVERY ONLY — NOT LEGAL ADVICE, NOT ENCODED LAW).\n\nSynthetic Picos-de-Europa-shaped bivouac/pernocta module used to test\nwhether the Axiom rules-engine paradigm fits a geospatial normative\nresolver. All thresholds are PLACEHOLDERS for engineering validation;\nthey do not reproduce any real provision. Facts (inside_park, altitude,\nzone flags) are the normalized facts that PostGIS would supply.\n\nDemonstrates: versioned rules (valid time), a parameter override\n(threshold change), authorization-required case, group-size condition,\nexactly_one single-outcome gate, and fail-closed behaviour outside the\nmodelled scope."
    },
